1
00:01:37,590 --> 00:01:42,930
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,630 --> 00:01:45,950
[Episode 8]

3
00:01:46,350 --> 00:01:48,310
You lowly performer,

4
00:01:48,340 --> 00:01:51,539
do you really think
you're fit to live in Danyue Pavilion?

5
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:53,820
Concubine Xia did indeed die that night.

6
00:01:54,030 --> 00:01:56,030
But whether it was mere coincidence

7
00:01:56,229 --> 00:01:57,789
or something more

8
00:01:59,350 --> 00:02:01,320
is truly impossible to say.

9
00:02:02,230 --> 00:02:03,070
Perhaps...

10
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:04,520
Perhaps

11
00:02:04,640 --> 00:02:06,300
my mother knows more about it.

12
00:02:08,090 --> 00:02:11,070
[Tingyun Pavilion]

13
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:12,960
Fourth Sister.

14
00:02:13,710 --> 00:02:14,570
Eldest Sister.

15
00:02:15,710 --> 00:02:18,000
I've been alone and helpless
since childhood.

16
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,130
Please take pity on me, Eldest Sister.

17
00:02:20,710 --> 00:02:21,770
What are you doing?

18
00:02:22,870 --> 00:02:25,000
Eldest Sister, please ask your mother

19
00:02:25,030 --> 00:02:26,960
to tell me what happened back then.

20
00:02:32,070 --> 00:02:32,910
Qingyuan.

21
00:02:33,630 --> 00:02:37,930
[Tingyun Pavilion]

22
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:38,870
Mother.

23
00:02:52,560 --> 00:02:54,960
This is this year's
freshly picked bud tea.

24
00:02:55,070 --> 00:02:57,130
It's at its most flavorful right now.

25
00:02:57,310 --> 00:02:59,630
If you find it to your liking,

26
00:03:00,430 --> 00:03:02,960
I'll have someone send some
to your quarters.

27
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,890
Thank you, Third Madam.

28
00:03:05,430 --> 00:03:07,080
All I've wanted since I returned

29
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:10,520
is for you to be willing to see me.

30
00:03:11,030 --> 00:03:13,120
You helped Qinghe the other day,

31
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:15,190
and I owe you a great favor,

32
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:18,980
so naturally, I had to come
see you as soon as I could.

33
00:03:20,310 --> 00:03:22,800
Qinghe is a good sister to me,

34
00:03:23,800 --> 00:03:25,120
just as...

35
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:28,120
you and my mother were to each other.

36
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,120
I imagine the bond
between you and my mother

37
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:31,910
must've been very deep as well.

38
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,750
My mother often said

39
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:37,870
that you were

40
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,130
her closest sister in this household.

41
00:03:42,150 --> 00:03:44,680
This bronze mirror is
beautifully polished.

42
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:46,360
Look,

43
00:03:47,190 --> 00:03:49,650
even the eyebrows
are reflected so clearly.

44
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,960
Since Master returned home
to visit the family,

45
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,620
he's been spending his nights

46
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:58,430
either at Luoying Pavilion
or in Liuhua Courtyard.

47
00:03:58,430 --> 00:03:59,760
We hardly get to see him.

48
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:02,520
Who still cares whether your brows are
arched like hills

49
00:04:02,520 --> 00:04:04,000
or fine as willow leaves?

50
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,080
What?

51
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:15,710
Master

52
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,570
stayed a night in your chamber?

53
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:20,800
Only for the first few days
after he came back last month.

54
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,399
Oh, right.

55
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,750
Don't take that formula

56
00:04:22,750 --> 00:04:23,920
I gave you anymore.

57
00:04:24,190 --> 00:04:25,630
It contains euphorbia.

58
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,460
It promotes menstruation

59
00:04:27,560 --> 00:04:29,240
and can also cause a miscarriage.

60
00:04:29,240 --> 00:04:31,000
If you happen to conceive this time,

61
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,400
continuing to take it
would harm your body.

62
00:04:33,870 --> 00:04:34,600
I know.

63
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,520
I've already stopped taking it.

64
00:04:38,240 --> 00:04:41,430
It would be wonderful if you could carry

65
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:43,040
a son this time.

66
00:04:45,070 --> 00:04:47,390
I'd actually prefer a daughter,
sweet and gentle.

67
00:04:47,390 --> 00:04:49,050
Look at your Qinghe, so lovely

68
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,240
and gentle.

69
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:54,000
Without a son,

70
00:04:54,360 --> 00:04:56,120
we'll all suffer—

71
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:57,720
mothers and sisters alike.

72
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,270
Fourth Madam!

73
00:05:01,560 --> 00:05:02,360
Fourth Madam!

74
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:06,120
Fifth Madam has come to Danyue Pavilion
looking for you in a huff.

75
00:05:06,120 --> 00:05:07,720
I don't know what it's about.

76
00:05:10,630 --> 00:05:12,160
I'll go see what's going on.

77
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:21,920
Chunqing!

78
00:05:32,630 --> 00:05:33,430
Mother?

79
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:44,830
Mother,

80
00:05:45,240 --> 00:05:47,560
why do you seem so distracted today?

81
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:50,940
Is it because of Fourth Sister,
who has just returned home?

82
00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:01,270
Chunqing was always...

83
00:06:02,560 --> 00:06:03,920
kind to others.

84
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:07,920
But in this household,

85
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:12,390
kindness is the most useless thing.

86
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,020
What do you mean, Third Madam?

87
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,430
Qingyuan,

88
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,560
I'm sorry.

89
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:27,430
But... at that time,

90
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:29,390
I was also...

91
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:31,870
unable to protect myself.

92
00:06:33,270 --> 00:06:34,510
Are you saying

93
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:38,810
Concubine Xia's death
had something to do with you?

94
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:42,150
How could that be?

95
00:06:43,310 --> 00:06:44,310
It's just...

96
00:07:07,630 --> 00:07:08,600
It's just that

97
00:07:09,310 --> 00:07:12,630
when I gave the euphorbia to Cui'er,

98
00:07:13,870 --> 00:07:16,670
I had no idea they intended to
use it to harm anyone.

99
00:07:17,510 --> 00:07:18,560
I didn't expect

100
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,130
that Fifth Madam...

101
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:22,680
Fifth Madam,

102
00:07:22,950 --> 00:07:25,560
this is a pregnancy tonic
Fourth Madam asked me to bring you.

103
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:27,560
She also said she would

104
00:07:27,560 --> 00:07:29,480
vacate Danyue Pavilion for you
to live in as soon as possible.

105
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,210
Put it there.

106
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:36,150
Help! She's dead!

107
00:07:38,510 --> 00:07:39,440
I never imagined

108
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,720
that Fifth Madam would die because of it.

109
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,150
I expected even less

110
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,580
that Chunqing would be forced

111
00:07:45,750 --> 00:07:47,950
to leave the household because of this.

112
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:48,830
Cui'er.

113
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:52,150
Tell me,

114
00:07:52,950 --> 00:07:54,560
how did Concubine Xia die?

115
00:07:58,310 --> 00:07:59,040
Speak!

116
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:01,950
It was...

117
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:07,100
It was Fourth Madam
who gave me a bowl of pregnancy tonic

118
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:10,100
and asked me to give it to Fifth Madam.

119
00:08:12,120 --> 00:08:13,000
Cui'er,

120
00:08:13,270 --> 00:08:13,950
you...

121
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,040
I didn't do it!

122
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,120
How dare you still deny it?

123
00:08:18,520 --> 00:08:19,010
[Qinyue Corridor]

124
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:28,320
With Mei Yinghua and Nanny Rong
pressuring me,

125
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:30,190
and Qinghe still so young,

126
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:34,440
I really didn't dare defy them

127
00:08:34,840 --> 00:08:36,039
by telling the truth.

128
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,840
I had no choice

129
00:08:39,080 --> 00:08:40,720
but to be their accomplice.

130
00:08:43,669 --> 00:08:45,120
I originally thought that

131
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,780
since Chunqing was innocent,

132
00:08:46,910 --> 00:08:49,240
the truth would eventually come to light.

133
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,150
Besides,

134
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:53,080
I thought Master wouldn't have the heart
to punish her.

135
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,610
-I didn't expect…
-So what?

136
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:57,870
With you covering up for the real culprit,

137
00:08:58,510 --> 00:09:00,640
how could the truth ever come to light?

138
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:04,360
Qingyuan,

139
00:09:04,790 --> 00:09:05,960
I am sorry to you

140
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,060
and to your mother.

141
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,960
I owe your mother a life.

142
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,530
You can take mine right now.

143
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:12,320
I've kept these words

144
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,270
bottled up in my heart

145
00:09:14,270 --> 00:09:16,000
for over 6,000 days and nights.

146
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:19,100
Now that I've finally said them to you...

147
00:09:21,240 --> 00:09:22,570
I feel released at last.

148
00:09:25,670 --> 00:09:26,600
Third Madam,

149
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:28,440
I believe

150
00:09:29,000 --> 00:09:30,440
your remorse is sincere.

151
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,440
My mother's spirit in heaven

152
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,320
surely wouldn't wish to
make things hard for you.

153
00:09:34,320 --> 00:09:35,650
But what's done is done.

154
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:37,480
What use is it

155
00:09:38,510 --> 00:09:39,970
to keep blaming yourself?

156
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:46,600
Qingyuan,

157
00:09:50,150 --> 00:09:51,670
the Xie family's waters

158
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,600
run deep—

159
00:09:55,440 --> 00:09:58,040
deeper than a girl like you
could ever imagine.

160
00:09:58,630 --> 00:09:59,440
Besides,

161
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:02,030
you're still relying on the Xie family

162
00:10:02,030 --> 00:10:03,960
to find you a good match.

163
00:10:05,080 --> 00:10:06,870
If your mother were still alive,

164
00:10:06,870 --> 00:10:09,150
she surely wouldn't want you
to ruin your own future.

165
00:10:09,150 --> 00:10:10,390
Find a good marriage?

166
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:11,790
And then what?

167
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:13,890
Live like you, Third Madam,

168
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:15,250
trembling with fear

169
00:10:15,790 --> 00:10:17,360
and walking on eggshells day after day?

170
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:18,640
Or like my mother,

171
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,000
framed

172
00:10:20,510 --> 00:10:22,710
and subjected to endless humiliation?

173
00:10:49,340 --> 00:10:50,070
Third Madam,

174
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:54,640
Eldest Sister is on the rise these days.

175
00:10:55,270 --> 00:10:56,730
You need to think clearly.

176
00:10:56,750 --> 00:10:58,720
If you keep being this foolish...

177
00:10:59,630 --> 00:11:01,140
Whoever used euphorbia

178
00:11:01,390 --> 00:11:03,320
to kill Concubine Xia

179
00:11:03,890 --> 00:11:05,170
already had the nerve

180
00:11:05,270 --> 00:11:07,670
to kill inside this household
19 years ago.

181
00:11:08,150 --> 00:11:11,410
Do you really think
she'll just sit back and watch you rise?

182
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:30,050
My life doesn't matter.

183
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,790
I only hope

184
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,360
Qinghe can marry out soon,

185
00:11:38,320 --> 00:11:40,030
and that you will too.

186
00:11:44,030 --> 00:11:45,030
The two of you

187
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:48,530
must get as far away
from this cursed place...

188
00:11:52,270 --> 00:11:54,030
as possible.

189
00:11:56,170 --> 00:12:00,830
[Danyue Pavilion]

190
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:02,870
Madam, please have some tea.

191
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:05,000
Thanks to your help, Madam,

192
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:07,870
our eldest daughter's marriage alliance
with the Pei family

193
00:12:07,870 --> 00:12:09,330
was able to come together.

194
00:12:09,390 --> 00:12:11,650
You're a great benefactor to our family.

195
00:12:13,150 --> 00:12:14,600
I dare not claim such credit.

196
00:12:14,600 --> 00:12:17,260
That's simply
Old Madam Xie's own good fortune.

197
00:12:18,030 --> 00:12:18,960
Actually,

198
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:20,200
I came here today

199
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:22,150
specifically to tell you

200
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:24,160
some wonderful news, Old Madam.

201
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:25,840
What is it?

202
00:12:25,870 --> 00:12:26,960
Happy news.

203
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:29,080
The happiest news of all!

204
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:31,610
What other happy news could there be?

205
00:12:31,750 --> 00:12:32,790
Ever since

206
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:35,630
the mascot entered our household,

207
00:12:35,910 --> 00:12:37,750
joyous occasions have come

208
00:12:37,910 --> 00:12:40,550
one after another for our family.

209
00:12:40,790 --> 00:12:42,550
That is indeed true.

210
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:44,870
I'm here to arrange

211
00:12:44,870 --> 00:12:47,130
another splendid match for your family.

212
00:12:47,630 --> 00:12:48,510
Do tell us.

213
00:12:54,270 --> 00:12:54,910
Madam,

214
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:56,860
please don't keep us in suspense.

215
00:13:00,030 --> 00:13:02,910
The heir of the Marquis of Danyang

216
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:05,450
has taken a fancy
to one of your daughters.

217
00:13:05,790 --> 00:13:07,360
Do you mean Chunzhi?

218
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:08,600
Yes,

219
00:13:08,600 --> 00:13:09,720
exactly him.

220
00:13:09,840 --> 00:13:13,040
I know you and the Marchioness of Danyang
are quite close,

221
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:16,030
so I'm just doing you an easy favor.

222
00:13:17,870 --> 00:13:18,750
I wonder

223
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:21,960
which of our daughters has caught his eye.

224
00:13:22,600 --> 00:13:24,670
Who else could it be but Second Sister?

225
00:13:24,670 --> 00:13:25,630
I can't wait

226
00:13:25,630 --> 00:13:28,760
to attend Chunzhi and Second Sister's
wedding banquet.

227
00:13:29,510 --> 00:13:31,550
I've watched Qingru and Chunzhi

228
00:13:31,720 --> 00:13:34,600
grow up together since childhood.

229
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:36,270
It's rare

230
00:13:36,480 --> 00:13:37,940
that these two children's

231
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:41,360
temperaments match each other so well.

232
00:13:43,870 --> 00:13:44,960
See?

233
00:13:45,510 --> 00:13:47,600
Chunzhi is mine after all.

234
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:57,360
Old Madam, it's wonderful
if you're pleased with this match as well.

235
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,670
The Marchioness of Danyang

236
00:13:58,670 --> 00:14:01,030
is also very satisfied with
your second daughter.

237
00:14:01,030 --> 00:14:03,390
The Heir and your second daughter

238
00:14:03,390 --> 00:14:05,550
are indeed a perfect match—

239
00:14:05,550 --> 00:14:07,720
well-suited in both looks and standing.

240
00:14:07,720 --> 00:14:09,000
But

241
00:14:09,360 --> 00:14:10,910
the Heir

242
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:13,200
has ideas of his own.

243
00:14:13,600 --> 00:14:16,360
That's precisely why they sent me here

244
00:14:16,670 --> 00:14:18,600
to sound out your feelings.

245
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,270
Madam,

246
00:14:21,750 --> 00:14:23,840
what do you mean by that?

247
00:14:26,030 --> 00:14:27,290
Please, speak freely.

248
00:14:29,390 --> 00:14:30,360
Yesterday,

249
00:14:30,510 --> 00:14:32,040
the Marchioness came to me,

250
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:36,240
saying that ever since
the Shangsi Festival, her son had been

251
00:14:36,630 --> 00:14:38,390
so lovesick
that he could neither eat nor sleep.

252
00:14:38,390 --> 00:14:39,790
She asked him what was wrong,

253
00:14:39,790 --> 00:14:40,990
but he refused to say.

254
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:42,910
The Marchioness grew worried

255
00:14:42,910 --> 00:14:45,370
and pressed
his attending page for answers.

256
00:14:45,550 --> 00:14:46,480
It turned out...

257
00:14:48,030 --> 00:14:49,240
the Heir

258
00:14:49,790 --> 00:14:52,970
had fallen for your fourth daughter

259
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:55,450
but hadn't known her feelings toward him,

260
00:14:55,600 --> 00:14:58,000
and that was
what had been troubling him so.

261
00:14:59,480 --> 00:15:00,840
Why is it her?

262
00:15:03,320 --> 00:15:04,150
However,

263
00:15:04,720 --> 00:15:08,370
the Marchioness has heard some rumors

264
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,440
and has been somewhat swayed by them.

265
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:14,000
Especially the rumors
about her and Lord Yan.

266
00:15:14,320 --> 00:15:15,030
Old Madam,

267
00:15:15,030 --> 00:15:16,560
please don't take offense.

268
00:15:19,630 --> 00:15:22,150
Our Qingyuan has a difficult fate.

269
00:15:22,670 --> 00:15:25,000
She has only just returned to my side,

270
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:27,600
and then there is
her complicated background,

271
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:29,960
not to mention
all the gossip she has endured.

272
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:32,200
It seems she's simply not fated...

273
00:15:33,360 --> 00:15:34,600
for

274
00:15:35,440 --> 00:15:37,000
such a good match.

275
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:40,200
Hear that?

276
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:41,870
Grandmother has spoken.

277
00:15:41,870 --> 00:15:43,720
Chunzhi is far beyond your reach.

278
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,780
You'd best give up any such thoughts!

279
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:46,630
Yes.

280
00:15:47,030 --> 00:15:49,260
Then allow me to congratulate you

281
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:51,440
on your happy union with Young Master Li.

282
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,670
Cut the act.

283
00:15:52,670 --> 00:15:54,080
I knew you were up to no good.

284
00:15:54,080 --> 00:15:54,720
Qingrong.

285
00:15:55,080 --> 00:15:55,840
What right have you to say anything?

286
00:15:55,840 --> 00:15:56,600
Enough.

287
00:15:57,030 --> 00:15:58,790
We have an honored guest.

288
00:15:59,080 --> 00:16:00,360
What kind of behavior is this?

289
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,690
Where are your manners?

290
00:16:03,120 --> 00:16:04,000
Report!

291
00:16:05,750 --> 00:16:06,720
Old Madam,

292
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:07,960
Young Master Li is here.

293
00:16:07,960 --> 00:16:09,670
He's brought gifts
for Second Lady, Third Lady,

294
00:16:09,670 --> 00:16:10,600
and Fourth Lady.

295
00:16:19,270 --> 00:16:20,600
Do you ladies like them?

296
00:16:21,240 --> 00:16:22,080
Third Sister,

297
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,390
mother-of-pearl mirrors like this one

298
00:16:24,390 --> 00:16:26,240
have been impossible to find lately.

299
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:27,120
Young Master Li,

300
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:28,960
where did you get hold of it?

301
00:16:30,630 --> 00:16:33,430
Second Sister's Hetian jade pendant
is prettier.

302
00:16:34,240 --> 00:16:35,300
It's elegant, refined,

303
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:37,490
and suits Second Sister perfectly.

304
00:16:46,910 --> 00:16:47,790
So beautiful.

305
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:49,150
Chunzhi,

306
00:16:49,270 --> 00:16:50,530
does it look good on me?

307
00:16:52,510 --> 00:16:53,370
Fourth Sister!

308
00:17:04,960 --> 00:17:05,890
Young Master Li.

309
00:17:06,030 --> 00:17:06,890
Fourth Sister,

310
00:17:07,349 --> 00:17:09,270
it's been so long
since the Shangsi Festival.

311
00:17:09,270 --> 00:17:09,960
I've thought of you often,

312
00:17:09,960 --> 00:17:11,030
so I came to pay you a visit.

313
00:17:11,030 --> 00:17:12,960
I've prepared a small gift for you.

314
00:17:20,109 --> 00:17:21,000
It's agarwood.

315
00:17:23,589 --> 00:17:25,510
I thought it would be something special.

316
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:27,240
Turns out, it's only agarwood.

317
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:30,270
Agarwood calms the mind and aids sleep.

318
00:17:30,270 --> 00:17:31,590
It's a fine medicinal ingredient.

319
00:17:31,590 --> 00:17:33,120
Thank you, Young Master Li.

320
00:17:33,270 --> 00:17:34,270
Then I shall not intrude any longer.

321
00:17:34,270 --> 00:17:35,160
I'll take my leave.

322
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:36,020
Fourth Sister.

323
00:17:36,790 --> 00:17:39,520
Is it because
you think this gift is too ordinary?

324
00:17:39,550 --> 00:17:40,880
This isn't ordinary agarwood.

325
00:17:40,880 --> 00:17:41,880
It's from Yazhou.

326
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:43,440
Yazhou?

327
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:46,730
Y-Yazhou? Yazhou agarwood?

328
00:17:46,830 --> 00:17:47,240
This...

329
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:49,960
Even a tiny piece of this
is worth a fortune!

330
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:58,000
Fourth Lady,

331
00:17:58,310 --> 00:18:01,040
First Madam wants you
to go to the reception hall.

332
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:30,830
Lord Yan.

333
00:18:31,830 --> 00:18:34,920
I've heard about the trouble caused
by the wicked servant in your household

334
00:18:34,920 --> 00:18:37,070
and have specially prepared
some rare treasures

335
00:18:37,070 --> 00:18:39,400
to help calm your nerves, Fourth Lady Xie.

336
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:41,810
The treasures are certainly fine,

337
00:18:42,070 --> 00:18:44,240
but Lord Yan, when will you stop parroting

338
00:18:44,240 --> 00:18:45,500
other men's flattery?

339
00:18:50,310 --> 00:18:52,310
And the rouge from Liuxiang Studio.

340
00:18:53,200 --> 00:18:55,200
Did you learn your ways
of flattering women

341
00:18:55,200 --> 00:18:56,530
from the brothel girls?

342
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,640
I personally chose

343
00:19:04,270 --> 00:19:06,680
this shade of rouge for you,
Fourth Lady Xie.

344
00:19:06,680 --> 00:19:08,550
In the candlelight at night...

345
00:19:12,590 --> 00:19:14,390
it looks especially beautiful.

346
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:21,590
You two, wait for me!

347
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,000
Lord Yan?

348
00:19:27,350 --> 00:19:29,430
My, Lord Yan, what lavish spending!

349
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:31,610
To win a smile from a beauty,

350
00:19:31,790 --> 00:19:33,920
naturally, everything must be the finest.

351
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:36,070
I heard you're good at appraising treasures,
Second Young Master Xie.

352
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:36,800
Why don't you

353
00:19:37,400 --> 00:19:39,360
check them for your fourth sister?

354
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:40,250
Okay, okay.

355
00:19:40,250 --> 00:19:41,160
Okay. Okay.

356
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:54,000
The patina
on the white-jade Yuhuchun vase...

357
00:19:56,200 --> 00:19:57,530
It's really beautiful.

358
00:19:58,480 --> 00:19:59,110
Lord Yan,

359
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:01,070
it's absolutely superb.

360
00:20:01,070 --> 00:20:02,670
This is truly a masterpiece.

361
00:20:03,350 --> 00:20:04,030
Really?

362
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,730
This antique was recommended
by Magistrate Guo.

363
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:11,010
I imagine it should be good.

364
00:20:11,510 --> 00:20:12,350
Guo Baofeng?

365
00:20:12,920 --> 00:20:14,960
Then you certainly
came to the right person.

366
00:20:14,960 --> 00:20:17,020
He has a lot of good stuff in his house.

367
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:20,780
Fourth Sister,

368
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:22,070
when it comes to gifts,

369
00:20:22,070 --> 00:20:23,880
quality matters more than quantity.

370
00:20:23,880 --> 00:20:25,750
If you happen to
like these common baubles,

371
00:20:25,750 --> 00:20:27,750
I can send you some next time as well.

372
00:20:30,030 --> 00:20:30,960
Young Master Li,

373
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:33,030
I still need to find my eldest sister.

374
00:20:33,030 --> 00:20:34,290
I'll take my leave now.

375
00:20:34,510 --> 00:20:35,200
Stop.

376
00:20:36,110 --> 00:20:38,840
I put so much thought into
preparing these gifts,

377
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:42,060
yet you won't even spare them a glance,
Fourth Lady Xie.

378
00:20:42,110 --> 00:20:43,440
You've truly hurt me.

379
00:20:45,480 --> 00:20:46,850
I can see

380
00:20:47,440 --> 00:20:49,900
your thoughts perfectly clearly, Lord Yan.

381
00:20:52,310 --> 00:20:55,110
Isn't there someone
with a good eye for treasures?

382
00:21:03,270 --> 00:21:04,270
Such lavish gifts

383
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:07,260
still couldn't persuade her to stay.

384
00:21:08,070 --> 00:21:09,350
Indeed.

385
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,550
What a pity.

386
00:21:12,720 --> 00:21:14,000
This is a fine piece.

387
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:17,130
This is truly a magnificent treasure.

388
00:21:21,500 --> 00:21:23,370
[Danyue Pavilion]

389
00:21:23,030 --> 00:21:23,880
My Lady,

390
00:21:23,880 --> 00:21:26,280
those two have come to
cause trouble again.

391
00:21:28,940 --> 00:21:30,590
Second Sister, Third Sister.

392
00:21:28,990 --> 00:21:33,900
[Qinyue Corridor]

393
00:21:30,880 --> 00:21:32,540
Baoxian, go prepare some tea.

394
00:21:33,070 --> 00:21:33,790
Yes.

395
00:21:36,740 --> 00:21:38,670
It's rare for you two
to visit my Danyue Pavilion.

396
00:21:38,670 --> 00:21:39,820
[Qinyue Corridor]

397
00:21:38,790 --> 00:21:40,110
Is there anything you need?

398
00:21:40,110 --> 00:21:41,270
Stop pretending.

399
00:21:41,830 --> 00:21:44,240
You were all smiles
when you congratulated me before,

400
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:45,830
all while secretly using

401
00:21:45,830 --> 00:21:47,400
who-knows-what spell

402
00:21:47,720 --> 00:21:49,200
to steal Chunzhi's heart away.

403
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:49,880
Exactly.

404
00:21:50,310 --> 00:21:52,240
Not a single word from this vixen's mouth

405
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,270
is true.

406
00:21:54,160 --> 00:21:55,030
I didn't.

407
00:21:55,550 --> 00:21:57,000
Chunzhi and I are just...

408
00:21:57,200 --> 00:21:57,920
Just what?

409
00:21:59,030 --> 00:21:59,680
Didn't he even give you

410
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:01,080
some precious agarwood?

411
00:22:01,580 --> 00:22:02,310
I already

412
00:22:02,510 --> 00:22:04,510
gave the agarwood to Eldest Sister.

413
00:22:05,030 --> 00:22:06,630
You gave it to Eldest Sister?

414
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:07,750
How dare you!

415
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:08,960
You.

416
00:22:09,920 --> 00:22:11,050
What are you hiding?

417
00:22:11,590 --> 00:22:12,720
What are you hiding?

418
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:14,400
-Chunzhi didn't give it to me!
-You still dare to hide things from us?

419
00:22:14,400 --> 00:22:15,240
Second Sister, quick!

420
00:22:15,240 --> 00:22:16,840
Give it... Give it back to me!

421
00:22:17,240 --> 00:22:18,160
You liar!

422
00:22:19,200 --> 00:22:20,860
Such a precious jade pendant—

423
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:22,800
if Chunzhi didn't give it to you,

424
00:22:22,920 --> 00:22:24,450
then what? Did you steal it?

425
00:22:26,270 --> 00:22:28,400
Since you like it, Second Sister,

426
00:22:29,200 --> 00:22:30,790
I'll gladly give it to you.

427
00:22:31,160 --> 00:22:32,760
Just take it, Second Sister.

428
00:22:33,070 --> 00:22:34,510
You and Young Master Li

429
00:22:34,880 --> 00:22:36,480
are about to be formally betrothed.

430
00:22:36,480 --> 00:22:37,640
I

431
00:22:38,070 --> 00:22:40,930
certainly wouldn't dare
harbor any foolish hopes.

432
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:44,300
Good that you know your place.

433
00:22:47,640 --> 00:22:48,680
Wait for me!

434
00:22:49,240 --> 00:22:50,400
Let me have a look.

435
00:22:50,680 --> 00:22:51,830
It's nothing special.

436
00:22:51,830 --> 00:22:52,920
Stingy.

437
00:22:57,640 --> 00:22:58,680
Guo,

438
00:22:58,680 --> 00:23:00,880
you actually still had it in you
to get yourself drunk?

439
00:23:00,880 --> 00:23:02,310
You recommended antiques to Lord Yan

440
00:23:02,310 --> 00:23:03,590
without telling me.

441
00:23:03,590 --> 00:23:04,720
Get up. Wake up.

442
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:06,590
Wake up.

443
00:23:07,440 --> 00:23:08,770
What did you need me for?

444
00:23:08,920 --> 00:23:09,640
Wake up!

445
00:23:10,590 --> 00:23:11,480
Wake up!

446
00:23:26,550 --> 00:23:27,350
Mother.

447
00:23:28,750 --> 00:23:29,270
Okay.

448
00:23:36,790 --> 00:23:38,350
What's wrong, Zhengjun?

449
00:23:39,030 --> 00:23:41,270
You've seemed rather unsettled
since early this morning.

450
00:23:41,270 --> 00:23:44,070
Did something happen
when you went out last night?

451
00:23:53,030 --> 00:23:56,000
My son is blessed with good fortune.
What could possibly happen to him?

452
00:23:56,000 --> 00:23:56,680
Right?

453
00:23:58,000 --> 00:23:59,000
Yes, yes.

454
00:24:00,070 --> 00:24:02,270
I simply didn't sleep well last night,

455
00:24:02,480 --> 00:24:03,680
feeling a bit drowsy.

456
00:24:04,070 --> 00:24:04,790
Head Madam,

457
00:24:04,920 --> 00:24:06,160
please don't worry.

458
00:24:12,160 --> 00:24:13,820
It's best if nothing's wrong.

459
00:24:14,400 --> 00:24:15,270
Zhengjun,

460
00:24:15,880 --> 00:24:18,030
as a descendant of the Xie family,

461
00:24:18,480 --> 00:24:21,070
you must understand
that you bear a great responsibility.

462
00:24:21,070 --> 00:24:22,550
Whatever happens,

463
00:24:23,110 --> 00:24:25,040
you must never let your guard down.

464
00:24:25,160 --> 00:24:27,590
You must not bring disgrace
upon the family

465
00:24:27,920 --> 00:24:30,070
through a moment's carelessness.

466
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:32,350
Yes,

467
00:24:32,960 --> 00:24:35,220
I'll heed your teachings, Grandmother.

468
00:24:37,880 --> 00:24:38,790
Eat.

469
00:24:39,880 --> 00:24:40,640
Go on and eat.

470
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:46,700
This is your favorite.

471
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:47,960
Have more.

472
00:25:03,160 --> 00:25:04,200
My Lord, please forgive me.

473
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:06,310
This case was supposed to be investigated
by the local government,

474
00:25:06,310 --> 00:25:08,270
and we ought not to have troubled you.

475
00:25:08,270 --> 00:25:11,330
However, the deceased
was a person of some importance.

476
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:12,600
Right, My Lord, look.

477
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:14,750
We also found this on him.

478
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:17,680
"It was all done by me, Guo Baofeng.

479
00:25:18,070 --> 00:25:19,920
My addiction to gambling
brought ruin upon my own family.

480
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:21,520
I regret it and feel ashamed.

481
00:25:21,550 --> 00:25:24,200
However, Xie Zhengjun also shared in
the illicit proceeds."

482
00:25:21,990 --> 00:25:24,220
[This guilty official, Guo Baofeng]

483
00:25:28,440 --> 00:25:29,300
Your Lordship.

484
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:34,830
Suicide

485
00:25:35,110 --> 00:25:36,510
and a confession letter.

486
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:38,790
Everything's been planned so carefully,

487
00:25:38,790 --> 00:25:40,750
as if they're afraid
we'll uncover something else.

488
00:25:40,750 --> 00:25:41,920
My Lord, you mean

489
00:25:42,550 --> 00:25:45,270
Guo Baofeng gave up his life
to take the blame for someone else

490
00:25:45,270 --> 00:25:47,510
and deliberately led us
to investigate Xie Zhengjun?

491
00:25:47,510 --> 00:25:48,570
Then the person...

492
00:25:48,920 --> 00:25:50,110
Who else could it be?

493
00:25:50,830 --> 00:25:51,960
Baofeng!

494
00:25:53,510 --> 00:25:54,640
Baofeng!

495
00:25:57,590 --> 00:26:01,270
I came too late!

496
00:26:02,920 --> 00:26:05,310
Baofeng, how could you be so foolish?

497
00:26:06,000 --> 00:26:07,200
Baofeng...

498
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:10,540
This grief will be the death of me!

499
00:26:11,960 --> 00:26:13,030
Lord Wei.

500
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:16,890
My condolences.

501
00:26:17,070 --> 00:26:18,930
You must take care of your health.

502
00:26:19,000 --> 00:26:20,070
Magistrate Guo

503
00:26:20,070 --> 00:26:21,860
left something before he died.

504
00:26:22,590 --> 00:26:23,850
You should take a look.

505
00:26:44,720 --> 00:26:45,550
My Lady,

506
00:26:45,550 --> 00:26:46,880
you really guessed right.

507
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:50,510
Second Young Master does seem to
have gotten himself into serious trouble.

508
00:26:50,510 --> 00:26:51,680
I'm just guessing.

509
00:26:52,070 --> 00:26:54,240
He was acting far too strangely earlier.

510
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:55,920
I don't know where he went yesterday,

511
00:26:55,920 --> 00:26:57,960
but something definitely happened.

512
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:59,160
That's easy—

513
00:26:59,270 --> 00:27:00,400
for anything big that happens in Hengtang,

514
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:02,800
just ask Lord Yan.
Wouldn't that settle it?

515
00:27:05,830 --> 00:27:07,200
Must I go seek him out?

516
00:27:14,510 --> 00:27:16,350
Baofeng
and the second son of the Xie family

517
00:27:16,350 --> 00:27:17,720
were indeed very close.

518
00:27:19,110 --> 00:27:20,140
But why

519
00:27:20,240 --> 00:27:22,570
is he now involved in the corruption case?

520
00:27:22,880 --> 00:27:23,720
Lord Wei,

521
00:27:24,110 --> 00:27:25,880
earlier, when Lord Yan was investigating

522
00:27:25,880 --> 00:27:26,880
the murder of the estate manager,

523
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:29,240
it just so happened to
lead to Magistrate Guo.

524
00:27:29,240 --> 00:27:31,590
Now, quite coincidentally,
he's turned up dead.

525
00:27:31,590 --> 00:27:32,510
Tell me,

526
00:27:32,720 --> 00:27:34,310
who should be held responsible for this?

527
00:27:34,310 --> 00:27:35,310
Are you saying...

528
00:27:36,750 --> 00:27:39,750
that Baofeng sent someone
to kill the estate manager?

529
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:40,790
No, no!

530
00:27:40,960 --> 00:27:42,880
That's utterly impossible, Your Lordship!

531
00:27:42,880 --> 00:27:45,200
There must be something behind this!

532
00:27:45,640 --> 00:27:47,750
Baofeng was timid by nature.

533
00:27:48,070 --> 00:27:50,750
If not for some villain directing him
from behind the scenes,

534
00:27:50,750 --> 00:27:53,550
he could never have done
something so reckless.

535
00:27:54,030 --> 00:27:55,960
But we've just examined the body.

536
00:27:56,550 --> 00:27:57,810
It was indeed suicide.

537
00:27:58,270 --> 00:28:00,400
Whether he was under threat, however,

538
00:28:00,880 --> 00:28:02,000
remains unknown.

539
00:28:04,350 --> 00:28:05,210
Your Lordship,

540
00:28:05,480 --> 00:28:07,550
do you have any suspects in mind?

541
00:28:10,160 --> 00:28:12,270
I have no clue for the time being.

542
00:28:12,680 --> 00:28:13,750
Lord Wei,

543
00:28:14,110 --> 00:28:15,840
might you offer some guidance?

544
00:28:22,590 --> 00:28:23,450
Your Lordship,

545
00:28:23,790 --> 00:28:26,270
there are some things I ought not to say.

546
00:28:26,640 --> 00:28:27,960
But since things have come to this,

547
00:28:27,960 --> 00:28:29,310
and the evidence is conclusive,

548
00:28:29,310 --> 00:28:31,290
I have no choice but to speak.

549
00:28:31,640 --> 00:28:32,960
The death of Baofeng

550
00:28:33,440 --> 00:28:35,310
and the disaster relief grain case

551
00:28:35,310 --> 00:28:38,040
must be connected to
the Xie family's second son!

552
00:28:39,590 --> 00:28:41,270
Does Your Lordship want to...

553
00:28:42,200 --> 00:28:44,350
thoroughly investigate the Xie family?

554
00:28:44,350 --> 00:28:47,210
Lord Wei, do you actually
want me to investigate...

555
00:28:49,160 --> 00:28:50,400
or do you not?

556
00:28:54,480 --> 00:28:56,410
Your Lordship, please don't jest.

557
00:28:56,440 --> 00:28:58,400
This matter is of great importance.

558
00:28:58,400 --> 00:29:00,800
Only Your Lordship can make that decision.

559
00:29:01,070 --> 00:29:01,830
I

560
00:29:02,110 --> 00:29:04,160
merely offer this humble suggestion
for the sake of

561
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:06,020
stability at the imperial court.

562
00:29:06,240 --> 00:29:07,400
In that case,

563
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:10,240
I shall have to consider it
all the more carefully.

564
00:29:10,240 --> 00:29:12,160
If the ruling turns out poorly,

565
00:29:12,350 --> 00:29:14,310
wouldn't that only compound my offense?

566
00:29:14,310 --> 00:29:16,000
After all, there are

567
00:29:16,400 --> 00:29:18,240
plenty of people at court

568
00:29:18,790 --> 00:29:19,750
wishing me dead.

569
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:31,440
Fourth Sister,
you truly aren't worried at all.

570
00:29:31,440 --> 00:29:32,680
If what you say is true

571
00:29:32,770 --> 00:29:36,760
[Fuyu Pavilion]

572
00:29:32,880 --> 00:29:34,000
that Guo Baofeng's death

573
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:34,960
was not suicide

574
00:29:35,270 --> 00:29:37,030
but a deliberate murder by someone else,

575
00:29:37,030 --> 00:29:39,590
and it just so happens to
implicate Second Brother,

576
00:29:39,590 --> 00:29:40,720
that old fox Yan Rui

577
00:29:40,720 --> 00:29:42,590
definitely won't let this rest easily.

578
00:29:42,590 --> 00:29:44,990
Xie Zhengjun has always
had a loose tongue.

579
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:46,920
Wei Changyan couldn't afford to

580
00:29:46,920 --> 00:29:48,030
take the chance.

581
00:29:48,830 --> 00:29:50,350
So he struck first.

582
00:29:51,270 --> 00:29:52,550
He isn't a fool.

583
00:29:52,830 --> 00:29:54,510
If I don't move against the Xie family,

584
00:29:54,510 --> 00:29:56,270
he and Xie Shu will remain united

585
00:29:56,270 --> 00:29:57,530
and escape unscathed.

586
00:29:57,880 --> 00:29:58,750
But if instead

587
00:30:00,030 --> 00:30:02,630
I send Xie Zhengjun
to the execution ground...

588
00:30:05,550 --> 00:30:07,310
The last two times Yan Rui made trouble,

589
00:30:07,310 --> 00:30:09,720
all he wanted was money and grain.

590
00:30:10,030 --> 00:30:11,720
If he's really coming after us this time,

591
00:30:11,720 --> 00:30:13,480
his purpose is probably the same.

592
00:30:13,480 --> 00:30:14,550
Rest assured.

593
00:30:14,720 --> 00:30:16,920
Grandmother won't let him mess around.

594
00:30:17,880 --> 00:30:19,200
But if

595
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:21,240
it involves tampering with relief grain,

596
00:30:21,240 --> 00:30:22,440
that is a grave crime.

597
00:30:23,200 --> 00:30:25,030
If this really reaches the Emperor,

598
00:30:25,030 --> 00:30:27,400
at best
Father and Eldest Brother's careers

599
00:30:27,400 --> 00:30:28,640
would suffer damage;

600
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:31,530
at worst, our entire family
would be exiled.

601
00:30:31,550 --> 00:30:33,960
Minister Xie is a 3rd-rank official,

602
00:30:34,270 --> 00:30:36,310
with students and former associates
throughout the Six Ministries.

603
00:30:36,310 --> 00:30:37,480
If we really clash with them head-on,

604
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:39,080
we'll take heavy losses too.

605
00:30:40,240 --> 00:30:41,480
Reach the Emperor?

606
00:30:41,750 --> 00:30:42,480
Eldest Sister,

607
00:30:42,480 --> 00:30:45,750
you underestimate Father's influence
at court far too much.

608
00:30:45,750 --> 00:30:46,640
If Yan Rui

609
00:30:46,640 --> 00:30:48,440
so much as lays a finger
on this household,

610
00:30:48,440 --> 00:30:49,070
the Censorate

611
00:30:49,070 --> 00:30:51,480
will have him buried
in impeachment memorials by tomorrow.

612
00:30:51,480 --> 00:30:53,070
Even if he is highly favored
by the Emperor,

613
00:30:53,070 --> 00:30:55,870
he'll have to think twice
about the consequences.

614
00:30:56,200 --> 00:30:58,240
Isn't he just hoping
that Xie Shu and I will fight

615
00:30:58,240 --> 00:30:59,510
until we're both gravely wounded

616
00:30:59,510 --> 00:31:01,570
so he can seize the moment afterward?

617
00:31:01,590 --> 00:31:03,160
Then we can only play dumb?

618
00:31:03,790 --> 00:31:06,120
Guo Baofeng's death is obviously a setup!

619
00:31:06,240 --> 00:31:07,110
Besides,

620
00:31:07,130 --> 00:31:09,460
even if we put personal grievances aside,

621
00:31:09,790 --> 00:31:11,000
he isn't the type

622
00:31:11,110 --> 00:31:12,680
to act so ruthlessly

623
00:31:12,680 --> 00:31:14,610
without leaving himself a way out.

624
00:31:16,270 --> 00:31:19,070
Since Wei Changyan
wants to profit from the chaos,

625
00:31:19,790 --> 00:31:22,250
I'll make sure it comes
crashing down on him.

626
00:31:41,370 --> 00:31:42,490
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

627
00:31:41,400 --> 00:31:44,000
Well, the Xie family is
a prominent household in Hengtang.

628
00:31:44,000 --> 00:31:46,030
How did they suddenly end up
surrounded by soldiers?

629
00:31:46,030 --> 00:31:46,960
I heard

630
00:31:47,000 --> 00:31:48,720
their second son
has committed a serious crime.

631
00:31:48,720 --> 00:31:49,400
Really?

632
00:31:49,880 --> 00:31:51,350
It has infuriated the Emperor.

633
00:31:51,350 --> 00:31:54,210
I'm afraid the entire Xie family
may be implicated.

634
00:31:55,240 --> 00:31:56,300
What are you doing?

635
00:31:56,790 --> 00:31:58,440
You've barged into
the Xie Residence without permission!

636
00:31:58,440 --> 00:31:59,790
Is there no law left in this land?

637
00:31:59,790 --> 00:32:02,030
We're acting under orders
to arrest the felon, Xie Zhengjun.

638
00:32:02,030 --> 00:32:03,790
Please do not stand in our way, Madam.

639
00:32:03,790 --> 00:32:04,990
What did Zhengjun do?

640
00:32:05,310 --> 00:32:08,190
Who dares behave so outrageously
in the Xie Residence?

641
00:32:08,190 --> 00:32:09,100
Old Madam,

642
00:32:09,720 --> 00:32:10,830
the Criminal Justice Office
is handling a case.

643
00:32:10,050 --> 00:32:11,320
[Imperial Writ]

644
00:32:11,590 --> 00:32:12,680
Please forgive us.

645
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:13,180
[Imperial Writ]

646
00:32:13,070 --> 00:32:13,720
Search!

647
00:32:14,400 --> 00:32:15,000
Wait!

648
00:32:15,350 --> 00:32:17,720
The inner quarters are
where the women reside!

649
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:18,920
This is outrageous!

650
00:32:19,200 --> 00:32:19,790
Stop!

651
00:32:20,250 --> 00:32:20,930
Stop right there!

652
00:32:20,520 --> 00:32:25,530
[Jingmu Hall]

653
00:32:31,830 --> 00:32:32,680
Yan,

654
00:32:33,000 --> 00:32:35,060
it's been so long since you last came.

655
00:32:35,830 --> 00:32:37,560
I've been busy lately, Granny.

656
00:32:38,070 --> 00:32:40,130
I haven't had pear curd in a long time.

657
00:32:41,550 --> 00:32:42,750
Here.

658
00:32:43,590 --> 00:32:44,550
Eat up.

659
00:32:46,880 --> 00:32:47,480
Granny.

660
00:32:48,480 --> 00:32:50,510
I've always had mine without honey.

661
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:56,350
Silly old me, I forgot.

662
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:58,550
It's Yunya who likes honey in hers.

663
00:32:59,270 --> 00:33:00,270
I'll get you another serving.

664
00:33:00,270 --> 00:33:00,880
It's fine.

665
00:33:01,350 --> 00:33:02,880
I'll just have it like this.

666
00:33:04,510 --> 00:33:06,000
Then I'll give you a box

667
00:33:06,110 --> 00:33:07,040
of loquat candy.

668
00:33:07,160 --> 00:33:09,220
They're good for soothing the lungs.

669
00:33:10,920 --> 00:33:13,030
Business hasn't been good lately.

670
00:33:13,350 --> 00:33:14,590
I made a lot.

671
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:18,680
They're not leftovers.

672
00:33:18,680 --> 00:33:19,940
They're freshly made.

673
00:33:28,640 --> 00:33:31,030
Ever since Yunya went to the Xie family,

674
00:33:31,510 --> 00:33:33,000
she rarely comes back.

675
00:33:34,510 --> 00:33:35,910
When she can't come back,

676
00:33:36,590 --> 00:33:39,680
she usually sends word through someone.

677
00:33:40,440 --> 00:33:43,160
But lately, the Xie household
has been in turmoil,

678
00:33:43,160 --> 00:33:45,760
and there have been
no messages from her at all.

679
00:33:45,830 --> 00:33:46,920
I'm really worried

680
00:33:47,160 --> 00:33:49,160
that she might get caught up in this.

681
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:52,590
Let go of me!

682
00:33:52,590 --> 00:33:54,510
What's all this noise
in the middle of the night?

683
00:33:54,510 --> 00:33:55,640
So noisy!

684
00:33:55,960 --> 00:33:56,440
Grandmother!

685
00:33:56,440 --> 00:33:56,890
Zhengjun?

686
00:33:56,890 --> 00:33:57,640
Zhengjun!

687
00:33:57,640 --> 00:33:58,400
Old Madam!

688
00:33:58,400 --> 00:33:59,060
Head Madam!

689
00:33:59,400 --> 00:33:59,960
Save me!

690
00:34:00,310 --> 00:34:01,000
-Son!
-Save me!

691
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:01,460
Mother!

692
00:34:01,720 --> 00:34:02,480
Save me!

693
00:34:02,480 --> 00:34:02,880
Son!

694
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:04,030
-Save me!
-Let go of him!

695
00:34:04,030 --> 00:34:04,550
Let me through!

696
00:34:04,550 --> 00:34:05,010
Mother!

697
00:34:05,510 --> 00:34:06,710
Lord Yan has arrived!

698
00:34:24,590 --> 00:34:25,449
Your Lordship,

699
00:34:25,920 --> 00:34:27,400
the felon has been apprehended.

700
00:34:27,400 --> 00:34:29,600
He even tried to resist arrest just now.

701
00:34:33,030 --> 00:34:35,550
Is this how your family treats its guests?

702
00:34:36,000 --> 00:34:38,030
You've certainly opened my eyes.

703
00:34:39,320 --> 00:34:40,520
I didn't kill anyone!

704
00:34:41,000 --> 00:34:42,000
I didn't kill him!

705
00:34:42,070 --> 00:34:43,670
Mother, save me!

706
00:34:44,840 --> 00:34:45,840
Lord Yan,

707
00:34:46,320 --> 00:34:48,840
if you had conducted yourself
as a guest ought,

708
00:34:48,840 --> 00:34:51,510
we would've received you
with all due respect!

709
00:34:52,230 --> 00:34:54,110
But you've brought soldiers here,

710
00:34:54,110 --> 00:34:56,480
surrounded our residence,
and arrested our family member!

711
00:34:56,480 --> 00:34:58,280
You've raised such a commotion!

712
00:34:58,670 --> 00:35:01,400
Have you thought about how this will end?

713
00:35:03,480 --> 00:35:05,760
My eldest son and eldest grandson

714
00:35:06,030 --> 00:35:09,440
have guarded the Northern Frontier
for His Majesty for years!

715
00:35:09,440 --> 00:35:10,960
-You...
-That's why

716
00:35:11,190 --> 00:35:14,440
I've come in person to guard
the granary for His Majesty.

717
00:35:17,360 --> 00:35:18,760
You should be thanking me

718
00:35:19,030 --> 00:35:21,360
for helping your Minister Xie

719
00:35:22,110 --> 00:35:23,310
purge the household.

720
00:35:23,880 --> 00:35:24,840
Let me go!

721
00:35:25,320 --> 00:35:25,920
Fan Zhong.

722
00:35:33,800 --> 00:35:35,480
Xie Zhengjun, second son of the Xie family

723
00:35:35,480 --> 00:35:36,510
of Hengtang,

724
00:35:36,880 --> 00:35:38,880
colluded with Guo Baofeng,
magistrate of Hengtang County,

725
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:41,590
to illicitly exchange 2,700 dan
of government disaster relief grain,

726
00:35:41,590 --> 00:35:43,440
substituting aged chaff and husks
for good grain,

727
00:35:43,440 --> 00:35:45,030
thereby causing further suffering
to the disaster-stricken people.

728
00:35:45,030 --> 00:35:46,110
When the incident came to light,

729
00:35:46,110 --> 00:35:49,190
Xie Zhengjun actually murdered
Magistrate Guo Baofeng

730
00:35:49,190 --> 00:35:50,360
and disguised the killing as suicide

731
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:51,550
in an attempt to conceal his crime.

732
00:35:51,550 --> 00:35:53,630
In accordance with
the Penal Code, Volume 2,

733
00:35:53,630 --> 00:35:55,000
authorization is hereby granted
for the immediate arrest

734
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:56,590
of the principal offender, Xie Zhengjun.

735
00:35:56,590 --> 00:35:58,280
He shall be temporarily detained
at the Court of Justice pending trial.

736
00:35:58,280 --> 00:36:00,070
Once the truth of the case
has been established,

737
00:36:00,070 --> 00:36:01,360
the principal offender shall be beheaded;

738
00:36:01,360 --> 00:36:03,020
the Xie family estate seized;

739
00:36:03,030 --> 00:36:04,430
all assets confiscated;

740
00:36:04,510 --> 00:36:06,070
and all members of the Xie clan
within the 3rd degree of mourning kinship

741
00:36:06,070 --> 00:36:07,000
exiled!

742
00:36:24,400 --> 00:36:25,760
-Mother!
-Zhengjun!

743
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:27,550
Zhengjun, oh, Zhengjun,

744
00:36:28,400 --> 00:36:30,320
your crimes run this deep.

745
00:36:31,070 --> 00:36:33,000
I should never have saved you back then.

746
00:36:33,000 --> 00:36:33,590
Rubbish!

747
00:36:34,630 --> 00:36:35,670
Don't you dare falsely accuse me!

748
00:36:35,670 --> 00:36:36,510
Take him away.

749
00:36:36,510 --> 00:36:37,710
-Lord Yan.
-Yes, sir!

750
00:36:37,920 --> 00:36:38,590
Hold on.

751
00:36:43,550 --> 00:36:45,810
Volume 7 of the Penal Code clearly states

752
00:36:46,550 --> 00:36:49,230
that the residences of officials
of the 3rd rank and above

753
00:36:49,230 --> 00:36:50,670
may not be forcibly entered

754
00:36:50,670 --> 00:36:52,930
except for the gravest crime of treason.

755
00:36:53,800 --> 00:36:55,260
Volume 12 stipulates that

756
00:36:55,670 --> 00:36:57,670
when relatives of officials
of the 3rd rank and above

757
00:36:57,670 --> 00:36:59,270
are involved in litigation,

758
00:36:59,360 --> 00:37:03,420
the case shall be handled with
the assistance of the Imperial Clan Court.

759
00:37:03,590 --> 00:37:04,710
Lord Yan,

760
00:37:04,710 --> 00:37:06,280
since you intend to investigate this case,

761
00:37:06,280 --> 00:37:10,680
why not proceed according to Article 36
and remain stationed here temporarily

762
00:37:11,280 --> 00:37:14,340
until the Imperial Clan Court
sends someone to assist?

763
00:37:22,480 --> 00:37:24,550
The east wing gets excellent light.

764
00:37:26,550 --> 00:37:28,320
And everyone in the household

765
00:37:29,710 --> 00:37:31,570
can also listen to your teachings

766
00:37:31,590 --> 00:37:32,760
day by day.

767
00:37:43,920 --> 00:37:45,030
Fourth Lady Xie,

768
00:37:45,550 --> 00:37:47,680
you're indeed well-versed in the law.

769
00:37:48,440 --> 00:37:49,400
How about this?

770
00:37:50,150 --> 00:37:52,070
From now on, why don't you stay with me

771
00:37:52,070 --> 00:37:54,590
and copy documents exclusively for me?

772
00:38:02,840 --> 00:38:04,110
Yan Rui!

773
00:38:05,630 --> 00:38:07,230
What's wrong, Old Madam Xie?

774
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:10,060
Don't tell me that red note you gave me...

775
00:38:12,360 --> 00:38:15,960
wasn't meant to send me a beauty
to keep me company while I worked.

776
00:38:21,710 --> 00:38:23,640
All departments, heed my command.

777
00:38:25,320 --> 00:38:26,920
Stand by for further orders.

778
00:38:27,000 --> 00:38:27,530
Yes, sir!

779
00:38:32,510 --> 00:38:33,280
They're out.

780
00:38:33,750 --> 00:38:35,270
They're out. They're out.

781
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:36,760
His Lordship has ordered us

782
00:38:36,760 --> 00:38:37,480
to guard the Xie Residence

783
00:38:37,480 --> 00:38:38,630
and make sure to watch them closely!

784
00:38:38,630 --> 00:38:39,840
Under no circumstances let anyone through!

785
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:40,710
Yes, sir!

786
00:38:40,840 --> 00:38:41,640
Out of the way!

787
00:38:43,070 --> 00:38:43,530
Well...

788
00:38:43,630 --> 00:38:44,400
Isn't he...

789
00:38:45,030 --> 00:38:48,130
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

790
00:38:46,480 --> 00:38:47,960
It's their second son.

791
00:38:53,030 --> 00:38:54,760
I hear you tend to cough at night

792
00:38:54,880 --> 00:38:57,010
once spring arrives, Fourth Lady Xie.

793
00:38:57,030 --> 00:38:58,510
I've specially prepared some kumquats

794
00:38:58,510 --> 00:39:00,190
and fritillaria bulbs for you.

795
00:39:00,190 --> 00:39:02,720
I've gone to
considerable trouble over this.

796
00:39:04,030 --> 00:39:04,560
Alright.

797
00:39:04,960 --> 00:39:06,360
You don't need to tidy up anymore.

798
00:39:06,360 --> 00:39:07,160
You may leave.

799
00:39:18,760 --> 00:39:20,800
Then I'll trouble you, Fourth Lady Xie,

800
00:39:20,800 --> 00:39:22,550
to make the bed for me.

801
00:39:23,360 --> 00:39:25,110
Since Your Lordship has already
surrounded the residence,

802
00:39:25,110 --> 00:39:27,480
killing or torturing us
is just a matter of your say-so.

803
00:39:27,480 --> 00:39:29,400
Why make things difficult for Old Madam?

804
00:39:29,400 --> 00:39:30,510
She's advanced in years.

805
00:39:30,510 --> 00:39:32,280
She can't withstand such a fright.

806
00:39:32,280 --> 00:39:32,920
Stop.

807
00:39:38,920 --> 00:39:40,150
If so,

808
00:39:40,550 --> 00:39:43,000
why did you hide for so long,

809
00:39:43,960 --> 00:39:46,360
forcing me to
resort to measures like this?

810
00:39:46,760 --> 00:39:49,760
Is there truly nothing in this world

811
00:39:49,760 --> 00:39:50,960
that you care about?

812
00:39:54,480 --> 00:39:56,800
That's interesting, Your Lordship.

813
00:39:57,440 --> 00:39:58,320
When all is said and done,

814
00:39:58,320 --> 00:39:59,650
we're both just acting.

815
00:39:59,880 --> 00:40:02,140
Who's to say who holds the higher ground?

816
00:40:02,230 --> 00:40:03,800
So, are you blaming me

817
00:40:04,150 --> 00:40:05,750
for tearing down your stage?

818
00:40:07,110 --> 00:40:08,170
It doesn't matter.

819
00:40:08,190 --> 00:40:09,230
I never wanted to

820
00:40:09,510 --> 00:40:11,040
play along with you anyway.

821
00:40:12,860 --> 00:40:19,980
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

822
00:40:13,280 --> 00:40:15,340
And if I insist on changing your mind?

823
00:40:16,360 --> 00:40:17,760
Careful, Your Lordship—

824
00:40:17,760 --> 00:40:18,800
one wrong move,

825
00:40:19,400 --> 00:40:20,280
and the hand on the blade

826
00:40:20,000 --> 00:40:26,890
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

827
00:40:20,960 --> 00:40:22,560
could be the one that bleeds.

828
00:40:27,020 --> 00:40:30,850
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

829
00:40:29,360 --> 00:40:30,420
You wouldn't dare.

830
00:40:30,940 --> 00:40:34,360
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

831
00:40:34,380 --> 00:40:41,650
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

832
00:40:41,680 --> 00:40:48,510
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

833
00:40:42,230 --> 00:40:42,800
What?

834
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:45,930
Do you think I dare now, Your Lordship?

835
00:40:46,760 --> 00:40:48,070
My dear lady,

836
00:40:48,540 --> 00:40:55,790
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

837
00:40:49,440 --> 00:40:51,370
I believe I've told you before that

838
00:40:51,840 --> 00:40:53,760
what I love most

839
00:40:54,760 --> 00:40:56,670
is breaking people who won't bend.

840
00:40:55,810 --> 00:40:59,690
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

841
00:40:59,720 --> 00:41:02,990
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

842
00:40:59,920 --> 00:41:01,250
The more they resist...

843
00:41:03,020 --> 00:41:09,900
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

844
00:41:05,000 --> 00:41:06,230
the more I enjoy it.

845
00:41:09,930 --> 00:41:17,430
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

846
00:41:17,450 --> 00:41:24,920
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

847
00:41:24,940 --> 00:41:26,700
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪
